    },
    "兼容 Chat Completions 的服务都可以，包括本机的 Ollama / LM Studio。密钥按接口地址分别存在钥匙串。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any Chat Completions-compatible service works, including local Ollama / LM Studio. Keys are stored in the Keychain per endpoint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
