            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "功能键语音快捷键需要辅助功能权限，才能拦截按键并可靠收到松开事件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Function-key voice shortcuts need Accessibility permission to filter the key and reliably receive its release."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单独按住约 0.3 秒开始说话，松开提交。和其它键一起按、或者只是点一下，都不会触发，也不会打开麦克风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the key on its own for about 0.3 s to start talking; release to write. Pressing it with another key, or just tapping it, starts nothing and never opens the microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单独的功能键在系统设置里可能被映射为亮度、音量等功能。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bare function key may be mapped to brightness, volume or similar in System Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单独的字母、数字或标点不能作为快捷键，请加上 ⌘、⌥、⌃ 或 ⇧。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bare letter, digit or punctuation key cannot be a shortcut. Add ⌘, ⌥, ⌃ or ⇧."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载前无法切换到系统键盘布局。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not switch to a system keyboard layout before uninstalling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载前的输入源切换未完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input-source switch did not finish before uninstalling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
