    "去开通": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去掉嗯、呃和口吃重复；「不对，我是说…」「不是 A，是 B」直接写成改正后的内容。标记词必须独立成句，「不对称」「这个答案不对，我们再看看」不会被改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes fillers and stutters; “no, I mean…” and “not A, B” are written as the corrected content. Marker words must stand alone, so ordinary sentences containing them are left as is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双击右 ⌘ 切换方向": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-tap right ⌘ to switch direction"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "反馈与兼容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feedback and compatibility"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现词库变化：%@。此版本仅支持检查，安装更新仍需新版应用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictionary changes found: %@. This version only checks; installing updates needs a newer app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "口误和个人词库均在本机修正，不联网。常见术语默认关闭；开启后每日从维基百科和维基词典更新（CC BY-SA），不上传语音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slips and personal vocabulary are corrected on this Mac, offline. Common terms are off by default; when on, they update daily from Wikipedia and Wiktionary (CC BY-SA). Audio is never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "句末不加句号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No full stop at the end"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删除此版本的本地模型文件。若正在使用它，将切回 Apple；以后可以重新下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only this version's local model files are deleted. If it is in use, Saylane switches back to Apple; you can download it again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只发送文字，不发送语音和图片。先显示本地结果，成功后更新；失败、超时或改动过大时保留本地结果。开启截屏精翻后，划选区域里识别出的文字和所在应用的名称会发送到下面配置的接口，截图本身不会发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only text is sent, never audio or pictures. The local result shows first and is updated on success; on failure, timeout or excessive changes the local result stays. With precise screen translation on, the text recognised in the captured region and the name of the application it was taken from are sent to the endpoint configured below; the picture itself is not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只截你划出的区域": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the region you select is captured"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只按 ⇧ 加字母会在输入时误触，请再加一个修饰键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
