            "value": "Checks the Rime-Ice dictionary manually; nothing is downloaded and your personal dictionary is untouched."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打字时选过的词记在这个文件夹里，只在这台 Mac 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The words you picked while typing are kept in this folder, on this Mac only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 Saylane 的设置引导和语音试用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Saylane's setup guide and voice trial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到这块屏幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That display could not be found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把划选区域里的文字整屏交给大模型翻译：按界面语境选词，品牌名和代码保持原样，译文尽量放得进原来的位置。先显示本机翻译，精翻完成后替换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends all the text of the captured region to the model in one request: words are chosen for the interface they stand in, brand names and code stay as they are, and translations are kept short enough for their place. The on-device translation shows first and is replaced when the precise one arrives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
