    "收起候选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collapse candidates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数学、科学、计算机、编程、生物化学和互联网热词。识别后按读音或拼写改回标准写法；人名和你们自己的词仍用个人词库。不含微信、翻译这类同音日常词。开启后每天从中文维基百科、维基词典的分类标题补新词（CC BY-SA）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maths, science, computing, programming, biochemistry and internet slang. After recognition, terms are rewritten to their standard form by sound or spelling; names and your own words belong in the personal vocabulary. When on, new terms are fetched daily from Chinese Wikipedia and Wiktionary category titles (CC BY-SA)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整句拼音更准：60 句日常句子里，对的从 35 句变成 44 句。万象语言模型（CC BY 4.0），从 GitHub 下载，只保存在这台 Mac 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whole sentences of pinyin come out right more often: 44 instead of 35 of 60 everyday sentences. The Wanxiang language model (CC BY 4.0), downloaded from GitHub and kept on this Mac only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
