    },
    "空格": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空格确认，数字选词，Shift 切换中英文。每个窗口各自记住正在输入的拼音，切换窗口不会误提交。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space confirms, digits pick candidates, Shift toggles Chinese/English. Each window keeps its own composing text, so switching windows never inserts by mistake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第%lld/%lld页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Page %lld of %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一次按住说话时系统会询问，也可以现在允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS asks the first time you dictate, or allow it now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等待授权…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for approval…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粘贴": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精翻只完成了一部分，其余保留本机翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precise translation finished only in part; the rest keeps the on-device translation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精翻把整屏文字一次交给你在「文字修正」里配置的大模型，按界面语境翻译；在那里开关。开启后，划选区域里识别出的文字和所在应用的名称会发送到该接口，截图不会上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precise translation hands the text of the whole capture to the model you set up under Text Correction, which translates it knowing the interface it belongs to; it is switched on there. When on, the text recognised in the captured region and the name of the application it was taken from are sent to that endpoint. The picture is never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精翻未完成，已保留本机翻译：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precise translation failed; the on-device translation stays: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精翻的回答无法使用，已保留本机翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's answer could not be used; the on-device translation stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "精翻超时，已保留本机翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precise translation timed out; the on-device translation stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统不支持这对语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system does not support this language pair."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统会询问是否下载这对语言的离线翻译模型。下载完成后这个窗口会自动关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system will ask whether to download the offline translation model for this pair. This window closes by itself when the download finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统尚未发现输入法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system has not found the input method yet."
          }
        }
