            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system refused to enable the input-method component (%d)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统没有自动添加 Saylane。已打开系统设置：在输入法列表下点 +，选择「简体中文」里的 Saylane。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS did not add Saylane by itself. System Settings is open: click + under the input sources and choose Saylane under Chinese, Simplified."
