            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trigger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "让快捷键在任何应用、任何输入法下都能用。可以跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes the talk key work in every app and under every input method. Optional."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "让快捷键在任何应用、任何输入法下都能用，并把文字直接写到光标处。不开启时，只有 Saylane 是当前输入法时才能说话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets the talk key work in every app and under every input method, and writes the text at the caret. Without it you can only dictate while Saylane is the selected input method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置…": {
      "localizations": {
