    "语音试用区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice trial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语音输入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Input"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语音输入快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice input shortcut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说写语言相同时只修同音错字、口误和标点，不改措辞；需要翻译时用整句原文修正译文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When speaking and writing the same language, only homophone typos, slips and punctuation are fixed, never the wording; when translating, the whole original sentence guides the translation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说出来，就写好了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Say it, and it's written."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话和拼音所需权限已开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permissions for talking and Pinyin are granted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话时显示底部提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show the bottom HUD while talking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话时的字和松开后的终稿都来自系统识别。下载更准的模型后，终稿由它来写，错字少一半以上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The words while you speak and the final text both come from the system recognizer. With a more accurate model downloaded, it writes the final text, with fewer than half the mistakes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话时的字总是由系统识别实时显示。选了下载的模型，松开后的终稿由它来写；它出错或太慢时，写系统识别听到的。错字数来自 150 段真人普通话录音。模型从 Hugging Face 下载固定版本并校验，只保存在这台 Mac 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The words while you speak are always shown by the system recognizer. With a downloaded model selected, it writes the final text on release; if it fails or is too slow, what the system recognizer heard is written. Error figures come from 150 recordings of real Mandarin speech. Models are downloaded from Hugging Face at a pinned revision, verified, and kept on this Mac only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说话时的字由系统识别实时显示；松开后由 %@ 写终稿。它出错或太慢时，写系统识别听到的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The words while you speak are shown by the system recognizer; on release %@ writes the final text. If it fails or is too slow, what the system recognizer heard is written."
          }
        }
      }
    },
