    "输入法在这里直接添加；麦克风会弹出系统的询问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method is added right here; macOS asks about the microphone itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入法尚未启用，不能切换。请在系统输入法设置中完成添加或允许。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method is not enabled, so it cannot be selected. Add or allow it in the system Input Sources settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入法尚未启用，请先完成系统输入法添加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method is not enabled. Add it in the system Input Sources settings first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入法已启用，但切换未完成（%d）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method is enabled, but selecting it did not complete (%d)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入法组件和主程序的版本不一致，请重新运行安装包。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method component and the app are different versions. Run the installer again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入法组件现在没有运行。切到 Saylane 输入法并点一下任意输入框，它会自动启动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method component is not running. Switch to the Saylane input method and click any text field; it starts by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入目标已改变，本次听写已取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input target changed; this dictation was cancelled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有允许屏幕录制。允许后可以用 %@ 划区翻译。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen Recording is not allowed yet. Once allowed, press %@ to translate a region."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有允许辅助功能：只有 Saylane 是当前输入法时才能按键说话；在其它输入法下不会触发，也无法直接写入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility is not allowed yet: the talk key only works while Saylane is the selected input method. Under other input methods it does not trigger and nothing can be written directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有允许麦克风。请完成授权，然后回到输入框重新按住快捷键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is not allowed yet. Grant access, then return to the text field and hold the shortcut again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个组合常被其他应用占用，可能在部分应用里失效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This combination is often taken by other apps and may not work everywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是未安装的构建副本，请先用安装包安装。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an uninstalled build copy. Install with the package first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里无法通过输入法写入，文字已复制到剪贴板，按 ⌘V 粘贴。允许“辅助功能”后会自动写入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The input method cannot write here. The text is on the clipboard: press ⌘V to paste. Allow Accessibility to have it written automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接尚未配置完整；会保留本地结果，不会向未配置的地址发送文本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection is not fully configured; the local result is kept and nothing is sent to an unconfigured address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出 Saylane": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Saylane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出后拼音照常可用；语音和截屏翻译停用，直到从输入法菜单再次打开设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinyin keeps working after quitting. Dictation and screen translation stop until the settings are opened again from the input menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选两种语言。“当前”决定说哪一种、写成哪一种；双击右 ⌘ 在这四种组合之间轮转。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick two languages. “Current” decides which one you speak and which one is written; double-tap right ⌘ to cycle through the four combinations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "都可以稍后开启。不开辅助功能时，在 Saylane 输入法下仍然可以说话和打字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All of these can be turned on later. Without Accessibility you can still dictate and type under the Saylane input method."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新下载修复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download Again to Repair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新接入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnect"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重试": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钉住后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While pinned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "钉住时冻结其他窗口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freeze other windows while pinned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "键%u": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key %u"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "键盘输入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyboard Input"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "雾凇词库": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rime-Ice dictionary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音频处理跟不上录音，本次已取消。请重试或使用更轻的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio processing could not keep up with recording; this session was cancelled. Try again or use a lighter model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风已允许。再按住快捷键说话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone allowed. Hold the shortcut again to talk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风权限未开启，无法录音。请在“隐私与安全性 → 麦克风”中允许 Saylane。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone permission is off, so recording is impossible. Allow Saylane under Privacy & Security → Microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风电平": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone level"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麦克风电平：说话时应当跳动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone level: it should move while you speak"
          }
        }
      }
